prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/tarball/version_2.5.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/zipball/version_2.5.0","body":"# ![PrusaSlicer](https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/raw/master/resources/icons/PrusaSlicer_128px.png) \r\n​\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n​This is final release of PrusaSlicer 2.5.0, introducing Arachne perimeter generator, Lightning infill, Pressure equalizer, STEP file import and various smaller features and bugfixes. The final release fixes a single bug found in PrusaSlicer 2.5.0-rc2. See the release logs of [2.5.0-alpha2](https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/releases/tag/version_2.5.0-alpha2), [2.5.0-alpha3](https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/releases/tag/version_2.5.0-alpha3), [2.5.0-beta1](https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/releases/tag/version_2.5.0-beta1), [2.5.0-rc1](https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/releases/tag/version_2.5.0-rc1) and [2.5.0-rc2](https://github.com/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/releases/tag/version_2.5.0-rc2) for the complete list of changes with respect to 2.4.2.\r\n\r\n## Bugfixes with respect to PrusaSlicer 2.5.0-rc2\r\n\r\n- Fixed seam-like artifact visible on certain models when using Arachne perimeter generator and Fuzzy Skin feature #8793\r\n\r\n## Translations\r\n\r\n- Updated translations\r\n- Updated Catalan translation (#8787, thanks @davidjuanesb)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prusa3d/PrusaSlicer/releases/76280954/reactions","total_count":155,"+1":35,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":64,"confused":0,"heart":37,"rocket":14,"eyes":5},"mentions_count":1}